------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ported code
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. Weft's optional compatibility adapter (internal/weft/compat) serves the
client of W&B Weave (Apache-2.0), but Weft's code, prompts and documentation
are its own; see
docs/weft/PROVENANCE.md for the scan that checks this and for the decisions
taken.
